  "body": "Just like the value of other types of buttons, the value of a submit type button should be marked as translatable AFAICT.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-translate-attribute\r\n\r\nsays:\r\n\r\n> * value on input elements with a type attribute in the Button state or the Reset Button state",
